  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Stormbound are proficient with all simple and martial weapons. Stormbound are proficient with light armor, medium armor, and shields, but wearing metal armor or using a metal shield impairs their ability to properly channel the storm that rages inside them. If the stormbound wears metal armor or uses a metal shield, they treat the essence capacity of their veils as 2 less (minimum 0). It takes half as much damage to sunder the stormbound’s veils and those veils have half their normal hardness while the stormbound wears metal armor or uses a metal shield. None of these penalties apply when wearing armor or wielding a shield created by a veil, even if the armor or shield they create is normally made from metal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/stormbound#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
